    <name>
      <text>9.1 Collecting terms and multiplying out single brackets</text>
    </name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<p>(a) Simplify by collecting like terms.</p>
<p> \({@a1@}p-{@b1@}r+{@c1@}p-{@d1@}r=\)[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]][[feedback:prt1]]</p>
<p align="right"><b>(2)</b></p>

<p>Expand the brackets and collect like terms:</p>
<p>(b) \({@expr2@}=\)[[input:ans2]] [[validation:ans2]][[feedback:prt2]]</p>
<p align="right"><b>(2)</b></p>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
